The '''Gates to the Mines''' is a [[Location]] that connects the area past the {{Zone|Dwarven Village}} to {{Zone|The Forge}} and {{Zone|Rampart's Quarry}}.

== Purpose ==
The '''Gates to the Mines''' connects to {{Zone|The Forge}} and {{Zone|Rampart's Quarry}}.

== Trivia ==
* The '''Gates to the Mines''' used to contain a {{NPCSprite|Ticket Master}} and the chest from {{NPCSprite|Bednom}}'s quest.

